# Serial captures from `pio device monitor --filter log2file`.
#
# These are working data, not evidence: a session produces hundreds of KB and
# every reflash restarts millis(), so a file is only meaningful alongside the
# notes describing which runs it holds. Captures worth keeping are quoted
# inline in Eng_Notes/ with the numbers already extracted, the way the July
# EFT captures were.
logs/
